---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { learningTracks } from '../../utils/learning';
---
<BaseLayout title="学习文档 | HlinForest" description="按领域组织的系统学习文档、课程与实验笔记。">
  <header class="page-head container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Learning library</div>
    <h1>学习文档</h1>
    <p>不是零散收藏，而是按先修关系、知识单元与实验组织的长期学习系统。</p>
  </header>
  <section class="container">
    <div class="learning-grid">
      {learningTracks.map((track) => (
        <a class="learning-card" href={track.href}>
          <span class="learning-area">{track.area}</span>
          <h2>{track.title}</h2>
          <p>{track.description}</p>
          <span class="learning-count">{track.count} · 打开文档 →</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="learning-note">CS336 已原生接入本站的文档阅读器，支持跨章节导航、全文搜索、公式、代码与 Mermaid 图。其余三套课程先保留现有成熟门户，后续可逐步迁移为统一阅读体验。</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
